  "releaseNotes": "Additions:\nUpdate package version for CV\nCreate config.yml\nCreate feature request issue template\nMerge pull request #20 from CSBiology/feature-ontology-#6\n(WIP) Testing unit tests\nAdd Create method for OboOntologyHeaderTags\n(WIP) Add method to convert Ontology to OboOntology\nMake OboOntologyHeaderTags a recursive class and give OboOntology a Create method using them\nAdd functions to create OboOntologies from OboHeaderTags\nAdd functions & methods for RelationType\n(WIP) Add functionality for parsing to OboOntology\nAdd .HasRelation functionality\nAdd .HasRelations method(s)\nAdd .TryGetRelations\nAdd .ContainsTerm functionality\nMerge pull request #17 from CSBiology/feature-cicd-#13\nCorrect folder path to match Unix's case sensitivity\nCorrect folder name in project file display\nInitial set up for RELEASE_Notes.md\nDeletions:\nDelete useless cache clearing\nBugfixes:\nFix typo\nFix typo\nFix critical typo resulting into bug\nCreate bug_report.yml\nFix wrong issue templates folder name\nFix bug in ToOboOntology method\nAdd constructionRelationship, fix some bugs due to new record\nAdd .fromTriplets + fix critical bug in OntologyHelperFunctions\nRevert \"Add diagnostic print line to fix unix CI error\"\nAdd diagnostic print line to fix unix CI error\nApply CI fix to Windows part",
